WRF-ARW Testcase with CFSR MET forcing (*)

This is a test case that uses:
  (a) CONUS SE quadrant domain (98W-75W, 25N-42N) with 1 nests (12 km)
      Lambert projection
  (b) Simulation time period from 06Z 30 Apr 2019 to 12Z 30 Apr 2019
  (c) MODIS geographical data, CFSR data
  (d) Goddard MP (4ice) and Goddard 2017 radiation (option 57)

(*) Saha, S., et al. 2011, updated daily. NCEP Climate Forecast System Version 2 (CFSv2) 6-hourly Products. Research Data Archive at the National Center for Atmospheric Research, Computational and Information Systems Laboratory. https://doi.org/10.5065/D61C1TXF.


